WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.615 --> 00:00:18.650
Oh, man.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:21.030
Now, this may sound bizarre, but

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:25.875
It's the first time, I've seen all my cars in the UK. On the track

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:27.865
What a view!

00:00:27.865 --> 00:00:29.860
Oh my lord! Jesus..

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:35.160
How nice, seeing all my baby's out for the day, together for the first time.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.220
Amazing.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:39.080
Amazing, amazing, amazing.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.460
What a beauty.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.610
Shall we try this one first?

00:01:15.235 --> 00:01:19.270
Right, the first time all the beautiful cars are out for the day together.

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:22.210
Time to get sweaty, so if you would be kind enough to do me a favour,

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:23.820
and get out the fu***ing way.

00:01:31.965 --> 00:01:36.990
This is my McLaren Senna. Only 500 of these beauties were made.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:41.750
It's like driving as fast as a roller coaster you've ever been on.

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:48.275
Oh my god!

00:01:48.275 --> 00:01:50.270
(You alright?)

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:53.720
Sh*t!

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:56.880
Oh my god, that is insane. No?

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.380
Oh my god, first time I want to sleep with a car.

00:02:05.205 --> 00:02:07.965
Beautiful. Boom.

00:02:23.505 --> 00:02:29.719
My Porsche 918. A 4.6 liter, V8 engine, with 2 electric motors.

00:02:29.719 --> 00:02:33.870
This is no Prius. 0 to 60 in 2.5 seconds,

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:37.090
this spider has some bite.

00:02:41.385 --> 00:02:44.880
This just gets better and better and better. Oh my god.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:04.965
Now this is what I call a car.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:08.585
Every time I sit in this incredible car,

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.900
It gives me chills.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:11.905
With only 200 made on the planet,

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.945
LaFerrari Aperta is on a different level.

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:17.385
Nearly 100 break horse power

00:03:17.385 --> 00:03:20.060
Fu*k me, it's fast.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:24.305
Just when you thought the day couldn't get any better,

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.525
It just keeps on giving and giving and giving.

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:27.710
What an amazing day.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:32.090
Some of the most amazing cars. My new, vintage,

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:35.075
And more importantly, some amazing friends and family.

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:37.595
And that, from a chefs point of view trust me

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:39.505
It doesn't get hotter than this

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.755
That, is a dream come true.

